      "label": "src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/owner \u00b7 PetController.PetController.processUpdateForm",
      "purpose": "The subsystem groups the domain model for owners, pets and visits together with the web-layer that creates, updates and validates pet data. It contains the `Owner` entity (address, city, telephone, collection of pets), the `Visit` entity, a `PetController` that handles form-binding, duplicate-name checks and birth-date validation, a `PetValidator`, a `PetTypeFormatter` and a repository for pet types \u2013 all of which are tightly coupled through calls to the same model classes and Spring MVC binding infrastructure. Because these classes share the same data structures and are invoked together when a user adds or edits a pet, they naturally form a cohesive unit that implements the \u201cmanage a pet for an owner\u201d use-case in the PetClinic sample application.",
